exercises.prompt:
What does this program print?

```perl
use strict;
use warnings;
use feature qw(say);
my $lang = 'Perl';
my $n = 5;
say "I know $lang " . 'and $n more';
```

What does this program print? Type the line exactly, including spaces.

```perl
use strict;
use warnings;
printf "%-6s|%4d|%.2f\n", "ab", 42, 2 / 3;
```

This program prints a warning on standard error and then a number on standard output. What number?

```perl
use strict;
use warnings;
use feature qw(say);
my $days = "7 days";
my $total = $days + 3;
say $total;
```

What does this program print? It prints two lines; type them separated by a single space.

```perl
use strict;
use warnings;
use feature qw(say);
my $word = "camel";
say "The ", uc $word, " has ", length($word), " letters";
print "no newline";
say " here";
```
